---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Career arc, projects, and background.">
  <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none dark:prose-headings:text-zinc-100 dark:prose-p:text-zinc-300 dark:prose-li:text-zinc-300 dark:prose-strong:text-zinc-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>

    <h2>The Career Arc</h2>
    <p>Starting in design, moving deeply into frontend systems, and now transitioning to game systems engineering.</p>

    <h2>Projects</h2>

    <h3>Game Systems Engineering</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Project Alpha:</strong> Real-time server architecture in Go.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Frontend Systems</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Project Beta:</strong> Microfrontend architecture scale-up.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>AI &times; Games</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Project Gamma:</strong> Integrating LLMs into NPC dialogue trees.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What People Say</h2>
    <blockquote>
      <p>Testimonial placeholder — replace with real quotes from colleagues.</p>
      <footer class="text-sm text-zinc-500 not-italic">— Name, Role at Company</footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
    <a
      href="/resume.pdf"
      target="_blank"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors"
    >
      View Resume &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
